Permit2ClaimPolicy::isTokenInWhitelisted
├── given policy is not initialized
│   └── it should return false
├── given token is whitelisted
│   └── it should return true
├── given token is not whitelisted
│   └── it should return false
├── given same token on different chainId
│   └── it should return false
└── given different accounts
    └── it should isolate storage per account